  WARN   missing-titleblock  图签未填:Name(图纸标题)、Drawed(设计者)、Description(图纸说明) — 交付图必须能认领(`sch titleblock --data '{"Name":"…","Drawed":"…"}'`)
→ floating pins: wire them, or mark the intentional ones NC — the listed pins are exactly what `sch no-connect --designator <REF> --pin <n>[,<n>]` takes
→ routing: reroute crossings in clear channels (L-bends); never run a wire through a pin
→ net names: fix mismatched flags/ports/labels before treating schematic DRC as clean
→ duplicate markers: a partial autoconnect stacked coincident flags/ports — sch prim-delete the suggested IDs (keep one)
→ marker overlap: net markers cover a part/each other — `sch destagger` plans the fix (add --apply to land it; it re-verifies and rolls back on any electrical regression), or re-run autoconnect with more offset
→ missing-partition: 多器件页没画功能分区框(铁律#15) — `sch zones set`→`sch zone-draw`(整纸版式 --mode partition);若 `sch zone-plan` 报 partitionOverlap,先 `sch zone-arrange --apply` 或拆页,再画
→ missing-titleblock: 图签必填项空着,交付图必须能认领 — `sch titleblock --data '{"Name":"…","Drawed":"…","Description":"…"}'`
→ redundant-net-marker: 同一线树上同网标志重复(修补残留)— 按 suggestDeleteIds `sch prim-delete` 清冗余(保留一个)
